WEBVTT

00:00:01.696 --> 00:00:03.758
LUCKY HERMIONE PAYS
ATTENTION IN HERBOLOGY.

00:00:05.716 --> 00:00:07.283
WHAT IS THAT?

00:00:07.327 --> 00:00:09.416
I DON'T KNOW.

00:00:09.459 --> 00:00:11.418
SOUNDS LIKE WINGS.

00:00:11.461 --> 00:00:13.681
[FLUTTERING]

00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:25.127
CURIOUS.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.217
I'VE NEVER SEEN
BIRDS LIKE THESE.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.611
Harry: THEY'RE NOT BIRDS,
THEY'RE KEYS.

00:00:30.654 --> 00:00:34.223
AND I'LL BET ONE OF THEM
FITS THAT DOOR.

00:00:38.401 --> 00:00:39.968
WHAT'S THIS ALL ABOUT?

00:00:40.011 --> 00:00:42.492
I DON'T KNOW.

00:00:49.107 --> 00:00:50.718
STRANGE.

00:00:50.761 --> 00:00:51.719
[LOCK RATTLING]

00:00:51.762 --> 00:00:54.722
Ron: ALOHOMORA.

00:00:57.028 --> 00:00:58.769
WELL, IT WAS
WORTH A TRY.

00:00:58.813 --> 00:01:00.945
UHH! WHAT ARE
WE GOING TO DO?

00:01:00.989 --> 00:01:02.947
THERE MUST BE
1,000 KEYS UP THERE.

00:01:02.991 --> 00:01:05.167
Ron: WE'RE LOOKING FOR
A BIG, OLD-FASHIONED ONE.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.429
PROBABLY RUSTY,
LIKE THE HANDLE.

00:01:06.473 --> 00:01:08.431
THERE! I SEE IT!

00:01:08.475 --> 00:01:10.477
THE ONE WITH
THE BROKEN WING.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:15.177
WHAT'S WRONG, HARRY?

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:18.789
IT'S TOO SIMPLE.

00:01:18.833 --> 00:01:20.704
OH, GO ON, HARRY!

00:01:20.748 --> 00:01:22.576
IF SNAPE COULD CATCH IT
ON THAT OLD BROOMSTICK,

00:01:22.619 --> 00:01:23.838
YOU CAN.

00:01:23.881 --> 00:01:26.449
YOU'RE THE YOUNGEST
SEEKER IN A CENTURY.

00:01:33.978 --> 00:01:36.285
[FLUTTERING]

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:46.469
THIS COMPLICATES
THINGS A BIT.

00:02:08.535 --> 00:02:09.797
Harry: CATCH THE KEY!

00:02:14.671 --> 00:02:15.672
HURRY UP!

00:02:49.358 --> 00:02:50.664
I DON'T LIKE THIS.

00:02:50.707 --> 00:02:54.145
Hermione: I DON'T
LIKE THIS AT ALL.

00:02:54.189 --> 00:02:55.245
WHERE ARE WE?
